      <h1 style="margin-top:10px">Golden Sun Password Generator</h1>
      <p class="lede">Build your party from <i>Golden Sun</i>, then enter the password at the start of <i>The Lost Age</i> to carry it over. Gold passwords carry everything, Silver drops items and coins, and Bronze keeps only levels, Djinn, story events and Psynergy items.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="toolbar">
      <button class="btn" id="btn-example" type="button">Load max example</button>
      <button class="btn ghost" id="btn-clear" type="button">Clear all</button>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="layout">
    <main class="editor">
      <section class="section" aria-labelledby="h-party">
        <div class="sec-head">
          <h2 id="h-party">Party levels &amp; stats</h2>
