          <div class="tiers"><span class="tier g">Gold</span><span class="tier s">Silver</span><span class="tier b">Bronze</span></div>
        </div>
        <p class="hint">The password stores which Djinn you own, not who holds them. They’re shared out again when you load the password.</p>
        <div class="djinn" id="djinn"></div>
      </section>

      <section class="section" aria-labelledby="h-items">
        <div class="sec-head">
          <h2 id="h-items">Inventories</h2>
          <div class="tiers"><span class="tier g">Gold</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="tabs" role="tablist" id="item-tabs"></div>
        <div class="slots" id="slots" role="tabpanel"></div>
        <p class="hint">Type an item name or its ID number. Set a quantity only for consumables like Herbs, Nuts or Game Tickets (up to 30). Items that can only be stacked in <i>The Lost Age</i> can’t be stacked in a password.</p>
        <div class="psy" aria-live="polite"><span class="small muted" style="margin-right:4px">Psynergy items carried <span class="tier s" style="margin-left:4px">Silver</span> <span class="tier b">Bronze</span></span><span id="psy"></span></div>
      </section>

      <section class="section" aria-labelledby="h-story">
        <div class="sec-head">
          <h2 id="h-story">Story events &amp; coins</h2>
          <div class="tiers"><span class="tier g">Gold</span><span class="tier s">Silver · events</span><span class="tier b">Bronze · events</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="events" id="events"></div>
        <div class="coins">
          <label for="coins" style="font-weight:600">Coins</label>
          <input class="num" id="coins" type="number" min="0" max="999999" inputmode="numeric">
          <span class="small muted">0 – 999,999 · Gold only</span>
        </div>
      </section>

      <details class="how">
        <summary>How the password is built</summary>
        <ol>
          <li>Everything is packed into bits: 7 per level, 1 per Djinn, 1 per story event and Psynergy item, 60 per character for stats, 9 per item ID, 5 per consumable stack and 24 for coins.</li>
          <li>A 16-bit checksum key is run over every byte (start at <code>0xFFFF</code>, shift left, add <code>0xEFDF</code> on carry) and then inverted.</li>
          <li>Each byte is XORed with the key’s low byte, and both key bytes are appended.</li>
          <li>The bits are cut into 6-bit groups. After every 9 groups a check group (their sum mod 64) is added.</li>
          <li>Each group gets its own position added (mod 64) and is swapped for one of the 64 password symbols. The alphabet skips <code>0</code>, <code>1</code>, <code>I</code>, <code>O</code>, <code>l</code> and <code>o</code> so nothing reads ambiguously on screen.</li>
        </ol>
      </details>
      <footer class="credit">
        <p>Password logic ported from the <i>Golden Sun Password Generator</i> spreadsheet by Dyrati (2023). The original Lua is at <a href="https://github.com/Dyrati/Golden-Sun-Password-Transfer" target="_blank" rel="noopener">github.com/Dyrati/Golden-Sun-Password-Transfer</a>.</p>
        <p>Your build is saved in this browser only.</p>
      </footer>
    </main>

    <aside class="tablet-col" aria-label="Generated password">
